  title: pods 22 and 23, empty
  about: 'pods 22 and 23: empty. The Lindqvist brothers, Ben and Tyl, woken the same
    night in year 140; they left after a week, and the vault door froze behind them.
    They scratched words inside'
  top: {fileID: 0}
  known: 1
